# ============================================================================
# VoiceSnip Configuration
# ============================================================================
#
# VoiceSnip uses local-only STT on the CPU or with GPU acceleration.
# No cloud providers, no API keys required.
#
# ============================================================================
# Settings Persistence
# ============================================================================
# All settings are automatically saved in voicesnip_config.json when you click "Start"
# in the GUI. The last used settings will be restored when you restart the
# application.
#
# Available Providers:
# - whisper-local-gpu: Local Whisper on GPU (Free, requires NVIDIA CUDA)
# - whisper-local-rocm: Local Whisper on GPU (Free, requires AMD ROCm)
# - whisper-local-vulkan: Local Whisper via whisper.cpp (Free, any Vulkan GPU,
#   recommended for AMD/Intel integrated graphics)
# - whisper-local-cpu: Local Whisper on the CPU (Free, no GPU required)
#
# Everything (Provider, Model, Language, Microphone, Hotkey) can be
# configured in the GUI!

# ============================================================================
# Vulkan GPU Selection (vulkan profile only)
# ============================================================================
# With more than one GPU, whisper.cpp uses Vulkan device 0. The installer lists
# the devices with their index; uncomment to pick another one.
# VOICESNIP_VULKAN_DEVICE=1
